  description={description}
  ogType="article"
  article={{
    publishedTime: dates.published,
    modifiedTime: dates.modified,
    author: author.name,
    section: "Protein Powder Rankings",
    tags: [
      "black friday protein powder deals",
      "black friday protein powder",
      "protein powder black friday sale",
      "cyber monday protein powder deals",
      "protein powder deals",
      "good price for protein powder"
    ],
  }}
  jsonLd={schema}
  stickyCta={{
    text: "See the Cheapest Powders Worth Buying",
    link: "/best-cheap-protein-powder/",
  }}
>
  <article class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <ArticleHeader kicker={"Deal Guide"} badge={"Price-Checked"} author={author} dates={dates} mobileAd={false}>
      <Fragment slot="title">Black Friday Protein Powder Deals 2026</Fragment>
      We do not list live prices that will be stale by lunchtime. Instead, here is the price per 25 g of protein that makes a Black Friday sale a real deal for each type of powder, and the target price for six of the most-bought tubs.
    </ArticleHeader>

    <TableOfContents>
      <a href="#short-answer">The Short Answer</a>
