    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pb-16 lg:pb-24">
      <div class="prose prose-lg prose-blue max-w-none text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
        <p class="lede">
          A real Black Friday protein powder deal takes about 30 percent off the normal price, which means under about $1.35 per 25 g of protein for regular whey and under $1.70 for whey isolate. Black Friday falls on Friday, November 27, 2026 and Cyber Monday on November 30. Below are the thresholds for every type of powder, built from the list prices of 104 powders in our database, and target prices for six popular tubs, so you can judge any sale in ten seconds.
        </p>

        <QuickPicks products={PRODUCTS} />

        <div id="short-answer" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">
            1. Black Friday Protein Powder Deals: The Short Answer
          </h2>

          <p>
            A Black Friday protein powder deal is worth buying when it brings the price at least 25 to 30 percent below what that powder normally costs, which for most wheys means under about $1.35 per 25 g of protein, and for whey isolates under about $1.70. Anything above the normal price for its type is not a deal, whatever the banner says. Black Friday is Friday, November 27, 2026, and Cyber Monday is November 30.
          </p>

          <p>
            We built the thresholds below from the list prices of the 104 powders in our <a href="/protein-powder/">label database</a>, checked between November 1 and November 21, 2026. The median powder costs $2.26 per 25 g; the cheapest quarter cost under $1.80. A sale that takes a normal powder into or below that cheapest quarter is a genuine Black Friday price.
          </p>

          <div class="bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-6 lg:p-8 my-8">
            <p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#38BDF8] mb-4">Black Friday 2026: The Numbers to Know</p>
